{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ShadyVale</strong> is steeped in secrets and mysteries known only to those who created them. Whether you're trying to solve the <strong>mysteries</strong> or escape the <strong>horrors</strong>, there will be an ending\u2014for someone, or something. <br> <br>Located somewhere deep in the coastal mountains of the Pacific Northwest. Isolated by sprawling terrain and sheer cliffs, this town is unlikely to be found by anyone unless you are intent of finding it. And on one particular day, after the fog rolled in, its uncertain anyone will ever find it again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Detective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as Mick</strong>\u2014Demo: Starts after Mick has arrived in Shadyvale and enters a strange basement. You will have access to your weapon, basic combat, and a few starting puzzles. Investigation board is locked in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764170/extras/Unreal_Engine_5_2025.05.26_-_22.44.20.07.gif?t=1749493560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764170/extras/Unreal_Engine_5_2025.05.26_-_22.44.20.07_1.gif?t=1749493560\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Survivor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as Alex\u2014</strong>\u00a0Demo: Starts with Alex exploring an abandoned area in ShadyVale. You will have access to your basic puzzles, your lantern and P.R.I.SM . Advanced lantern features are locked in the demo.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the P.R.I.S.M to see into another plane of reality<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764170/extras/Alex_Lens.gif?t=1749493560\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_u