arting puzzles. Investigation board is locked in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764170/extras/Unreal_Engine_5_2025.05.26_-_22.44.20.07.gif?t=1749493560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764170/extras/Unreal_Engine_5_2025.05.26_-_22.44.20.07_1.gif?t=1749493560\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Survivor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as Alex\u2014</strong>\u00a0Demo: Starts with Alex exploring an abandoned area in ShadyVale. You will have access to your basic puzzles, your lantern and P.R.I.SM . Advanced lantern features are locked in the demo.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the P.R.I.S.M to see into another plane of reality<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764170/extras/Alex_Lens.gif?t=1749493560\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OR the lantern to reveal hidden text<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764170/extras/Alex_prism.gif?t=1749493560\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["DeeperMinds"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3223730","name":"The Waning Of ShadyVale"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764170/2e9d27dd8f554dde9abf1d87808335026d29fe71/header.jpg?t=1749493560","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257148613,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148613/movie480.mp4?t=1749002156","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148613/movie_max.mp4?t=1749002156"},"name":"TWOSVDemoTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s